Hey, I am Karl! I am currently studying Computer Science at the University of Leipzig.

## Things that I love:

- I love both cats and dogs, but I think that raccoons are the cutest ones.
- I love cookies and cooking! Do you have cookies? Do you no longer need them or can spare some? Then I am happy to ~~eat everything you have~~ help you.
- I love writing my own programming language. I have a finished a test run with [Nyx](https://github.com/Kiyotoko/nyx) and currently write the new compiled language [Tau](https://github.com/tau-lang/tau) together with a [friend](https://lovirent.eu/).
